    "description": {
      "value": "This +2 resilient padded armor is woven from many strands of gut cord strung with dried organs and preserved xulgath scent glands. When worn, it infuses your body with a ghastly and nauseating flavor.\n\n- **Activate:** Free Action\n- **Trigger:** You are grabbed or are hit by an unarmed attack\n\nYour attacker must attempt a DC 28 Fortitude saving throw. Creatures with a stench aura, such as otyughs and xulgaths, are immune to this effect.\n\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected and is immune to the effects of the noxious jerkin for 1 minute.\n- **Failure:** The creature is sickened 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is sickened 1 and is slowed 1 for 1 round."
    },
